  "pass_a_gloss": "Through eyes to be raised up and by the shaking of the mind, but let all things toward God be written and impressed. 34 If anyone seeks to perceive the divine character of the Word of God according to the flesh from material colors... let him be anathema.\nengraved and impressed let it be for all\nto be elevated through the eyes and to have the mind in a state of agitation\nby the eyes to be lofty and by the agitations of the mind, but written down and impressed let it be to all things concerning God\nif anyone the divine of God's word character according to the incarnation from material colors practices to understand... let it be accursed\nby the eyes to be lofty and by the agitations of the mind, but written down and impressed let it be to all things concerning God\nto be lifted up",
